  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Previously, when selecting a user in an Impostor avatar, the \"Avatar info\" option was not available in the quick menu, but it *was* available in the main menu when you expanded their profile. It was very useful for when I wanted to know how bad someone's avatar truly was, without ever actually showing them. \n\nI'm pretty sure I filed a report about the option not being available in the Quick menu, but since that was never fixed, now we're a situation where it's not possible at all anymore. \n\nPlease allow us to view someone's avatar stats from both the quick menu and main menu, and additionally (I can make another canny), also let us view avatar stats for when someone is in a **fallback** avatar. Viewing stats of someonme in a fallback would show the stats of the fallback, with no way to view the stats of their true avatar.",
